{
  "_comment": "分层完整性基线的层定义（数据，不是代码）。判据见 BASELINE.md：按'改了会怎样'分优先级选目录，按'本来就在变'排除噪声。",
  "tiers": {
    "tier1": {
      "why": "改了＝任意代码执行 / 直接给我下指令 / 改信任边界 / 换身份 —— 价值最高且体量可控",
      "include": [
        ".githooks/**",
        "scripts/**",
        "patches/**",
        "portable/agent/AGENTS.md",
        "portable/agent/APPEND_SYSTEM.md",
        "portable/agent/skills/**",
        "packs/**",
        "portable/agent/settings.json",
        "portable/agent/auth.json",
        "portable/agent/models.json",
        "portable/agent/models-store.json",
        "portable/agent/modes.json",
        "portable/agent/trust.json",
        "portable/agent/scheduled-seeds.json",
        "sync/**",
        "package.json",
        "package-lock.json",
        "custom/package.json"
      ]
    },
    "tier2": {
      "why": "进程内代码入口（真正的加载点，比整个 custom/** 小得多）+ 系统级持久化点（仓库基线管不到）",
      "include": [
        "custom/bootstrap.ts",
        "custom/adapters/**",
        "custom/core/**",
        "~/.bashrc",
        "~/.profile",
        "~/.zshrc",
        "~/.ssh/authorized_keys",
        "~/.config/autostart/**",
        "~/AppData/Roaming/Microsoft/Windows/Start Menu/Programs/Startup/**",
        "~/.ssh/config"
      ],
      "note": "以 ~ 开头的路径走 os.homedir()，**存在才纳入**（Windows 启动文件夹即按此形态覆盖）。**覆盖不到的（如实）**：Windows 注册表 Run 键与任务计划——两者都需要外部命令（reg/schtasks）或管理员权限，违反\"只用 Node 标准库\"的便携化硬约束 ⇒ 本层不收；PATH 目录内容体量巨大且常变 ⇒ 也不收。详见 BASELINE.md 第九节。"
    }
  },
  "exclude": [
    "**/node_modules/**",
    "**/.venv/**",
    "**/__pycache__/**",
    "portable/memory/**",
    "packs/drafts/**",
    "dist/**",
    "**/*.log"
  ],
  "excludeWhy": "排除判据是'本来就在变'，不是'不重要'：node_modules/.venv/dist 是产物；portable/memory 是运行时数据（会话/日志/统计每分钟都在写）；packs/drafts 是 agent 生成 SKILL 草稿的输出目录（task-summarizer 会往里写）；日志同理。把噪声纳入基线的后果不是更安全，而是守门天天报警然后被无视——那比没有基线更糟。",
  "storage": "portable/memory/security/<tier>-baseline.json（运行时目录，不入库，与 pi-backup 的 .backup-baseline 惯例一致）",
  "efficiency": {
    "record": [
      "path",
      "size",
      "mtimeMs",
      "sha256"
    ],
    "verify": "先比 size+mtimeMs，只有不一致才重算 sha256 ⇒ 日常 O(改动数)",
    "targets": {
      "tier1_init_ms": 100,
      "tier1_verify_warm_ms": 100
    }
  },
  "tier3": {
    "why": "系统级持久化点（Windows 注册表 Run 键 / 任务计划；Linux-macOS 的 cron）—— 它们不是文件，只能调只读查询命令。用户已批准为此破一次只用 Node 标准库的约束，但只限本层。",
    "defaultOff": true,
    "requiresExternalCommands": true,
    "readOnlyOnly": true,
    "allowlist": [
      "reg query",
      "schtasks /query",
      "crontab -l"
    ],
    "sources": [
      {
        "key": "env:crontab",
        "platforms": [
          "linux",
          "darwin"
        ],
        "cmd": "crontab",
        "args": [
          "-l"
        ],
        "note": "用户级 cron（只读）；没有 crontab 条目时可能非零退出 ⇒ not-scanned"
      },
      {
        "key": "env:win-run-hkcu",
        "platforms": [
          "win32"
        ],
        "cmd": "reg",
        "args": [
          "query",
          "HKCU\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run"
        ],
        "note": "当前用户自启（只读查询）"
      },
      {
        "key": "env:win-run-hklm",
        "platforms": [
          "win32"
        ],
        "cmd": "reg",
        "args": [
          "query",
          "HKLM\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run"
        ],
        "note": "全机自启（只读查询）"
      },
      {
        "key": "env:win-tasks",
        "platforms": [
          "win32"
        ],
        "cmd": "schtasks",
        "args": [
          "/query",
          "/fo",
          "LIST"
        ],
        "note": "任务计划（只读查询；普通用户可能看不到全部）"
      },
      {
        "key": "env:path-value",
        "platforms": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": false,
        "cmd": "-",
        "args": [],
        "note": "PATH 变量值本身（更便宜的替代方案，可用来发现 PATH 被改）；按用户要求 PATH 相关默认不收"
      },
      {
        "key": "env:path-dirs",
        "platforms": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": false,
        "cmd": "-",
        "args": [],
        "note": "PATH 目录内容：体量巨大且随安装常变 ⇒ 纳入即误报，默认关"
      }
    ]
  }
}
